 for both residential and commercial clients. These offerings include the supply and installation of EV chargers, the development of essential charging infrastructure, a central management system, an e-payment processing hub, intelligent load management capabilities, and license plate recognition technology for EVs and smart parking. Additionally, the company provides traditional printing, typesetting, and translation services. Its energy management division offers solutions such as EV batteries and solar photovoltaic (PV) systems. Founded in 1980, the company was formerly known as Elegance Commercial and Financial Printing Group Limited before rebranding as Cornerstone Technologies Holdings Limited in October 2020. Headquartered in Tsim Sha Tsui, Hong Kong, it operates as a subsidiary of Global Fortune Global Limited.","description_en":"Cornerstone Technologies Holdings Limited, based in Hong Kong, operates in three core sectors: printing, electric vehicle (EV) charging, and energy solutions. The company delivers integrated EV charging solutions tailored for both residential and commercial clients. These offerings include the supply and installation of EV chargers, the development of essential charging infrastructure, a central management system, an e-payment processing hub, intelligent load management capabilities, and license plate recognition technology for EVs and smart parking. Additionally, the company provides traditional printing, typesetting, and translation services. Its energy management division offers solutions such as EV batteries and solar photovoltaic (PV) systems. Founded in 1980, the company was formerly known as Elegance Commercial and Financial Printing Group Limited before rebranding as Cornerstone Technologies Holdings Limited in October 2020. Headquartered in Tsim Sha Tsui, Hong Kong, it operates as a subsidiary of Global Fortune Global Limited.","description_zh":null,"address":"New East Ocean Centre","city":"Hong Kong","state":null,"zip":nul